%U A398034 128383690706001,1157878415690912,10490811099175515,95443056429856524,871554833667734098,7985652144873717789,73394156515762280147,676448403717315919048
%N A398034 Number of rooted unlabeled 6-gonal cacti having n blocks.
%H A398034 Frederic G. Speyser, <a href="https://github.com/frederic-speyser/non-plane-mgonal-cacti">mgonal_cactus_series.py</a>
%F A398034 G.f. s(x) satisfies s(x) = x + x*(exp(Sum_{i>=1} K_C(x^i)/i) - 1), with K_C(x) = (1/2)*(s(x)^5 + s(x)*s(x^2)^2) for m=6 (even case). No closed form is known for the critical value or the radius of convergence when m is even.
%o A398034 (Python) # See Links
%o A398034 (PARI) EulerT(v)={Vec(exp(x*Ser(dirmul(v, vector(#v, n, 1/n))))-1, -#v)}
%o A398034 seq(n)={my(v=[]); for(n=1, n, my(g=1+x*Ser(v)); v=EulerT(Vec((g^5 + g*subst(g^2, x, x^2))/2))); concat([1], v)}
%Y A398034 Column k=6 of A332648.
%Y A398034 Cf. A398035 (unrooted).
